    "The gate detects and refuses; it repairs nothing. Every repair belongs to the surface's own owner record.",
    "The recorded launcher disposition is a profile fact, not a verdict. `included` claims only that the launcher is in the closure this gate covers; it claims nothing about whether the launcher currently meets its bar. `excluded` would claim only that no reachable path to the launcher survives, never that the launcher's obligations were discharged."
